https://youtube.com`,f10:"第四季度项目预约中 · 剩余 3 个名额",f11:"美国纽约市西 21 街 54 号，邮编 10010",f12:"周一至周五 09:00–18:00（美国东部时间）",f13:`1-5 09:00-18:00`,n1:`1`}],work:[{slug:`northwind-dental`,f1:`Northwind Dental`,f2:"医疗健康",f3:"让预约量提升 38% 的语音智能体",f4:`+38%`,f5:"预约量",f6:"六家诊所共用一条永不漏接的电话线。智能体直接在诊所管理软件中预约、改约和确认就诊。",f7:"语音智能体",img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/OPO7hpxO5fFgicqBiebGwosE.webp`,f8:"六家诊所共用一条电话线。下午五点后和午休时，三分之一的来电无人接听，每一通漏接都意味着一次流失的预约。",f9:"语音智能体使用诊所的沟通风格，在诊所管理软件中预约、改约和确认就诊；涉及医疗判断的问题一律转交护士。",f10:"+38%|预约量;0|非工作时间漏接来电;4.8/5|来电者评分;11 h|每周为前台节省的时间",f11:"患者听不出这是智能体，前台终于有时间照顾现场的人了。",f12:"Dr. Sarah Kim, 医疗总监",f13:`4 weeks`,f14:`Vapi, Twilio, Dentrix, HubSpot`,n1:`1`},{slug:`ledgerly`,f1:`Ledgerly`,f2:"财会",f3:"月末结账从 9 天缩短至 2 天",f4:`2 days`,f5:"月末结账",f6:"由智能体核对发票、收据和银行流水，异常情况由人工审批。",f7:"工作流自动化",img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/xC399cfk7wneLE2CiZd0LCKY70.webp`,f8:"月末结账耗时九天：需要在三个工具之间，手工核对 2,000 张发票、收据和银行流水。",f9:"发票智能体读取每份单据，与采购订单和银行流水核对，在 Xero 中入账，仅将异常情况交给人工处理。",f10:"2 天|月末结账;1,900|每周发票量;97%|无需人工匹配;9 h|每周节省时间",f11:"他们找出了我们每周浪费的九个小时，并将这些工作自动化。",f12:"Marcus Webb, 财务负责人",f13:`5 weeks`,f14:`n8n, Xero, Google Drive, Slack`,n1:`2`},{slug:`oakline-home`,f1:`Oakline Home`,f2:"电子商务",f3:"每 10 张客服工单中有 7 张由 AI 解决",f4:`71%`,f5:"工单由 AI 解决",f6:"根据 Shopify 数据，数秒内回答订单、退货与配送变更问题。",f7:"客服智能体",img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/A1LSpWqZartLRT6sPWVxN0Ijbo.webp`,f8:"订单、退货和配送变更咨询挤满客服系统，高峰时段需要六小时才能回复。",f9:"通过聊天和邮件提供服务的客服智能体，根据 Shopify 数据和配送政策回答问题、处理退货，并在升级人工时附上回复草稿。",f10:"71%|工单由 AI 解决;38 s|首次回复;+9 分|CSAT;3x|每人处理工单量",f11:"71% 的工单无需人工处理，客户满意度也提升了。",f12:"Priya Nair, 客户体验负责人",f13:`4 weeks`,f14:`Gorgias, Shopify, OpenAI, Slack`,n1:`3`},{slug:`vantage-legal`,f1:`Vantage Legal`,f2:"法律服务",f3:"数秒找到每一份判例",f4:`9 s`,f5:"平均搜索用时",f6:"覆盖 14 年案件资料的私有知识库，遵循访问权限，回答附带来源。",f7:"AI 知识库",img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/hPOHK0EMfYfzD6Gkwr40RfxeeRk.webp`,f8:"14 年的案件资料分散在文件夹中，只有合伙人才知道如何检索。",f9:"遵循访问权限的私有知识库，用通俗语言回答，并引用具体文档和页码。",f10:"9 s|平均搜索用时;14 年|年案件资料已索引;100%|回答附带来源;6 h|每位律师每周节省时间",f11:"这是我们的律师每天早上最先打开的工具。",f12:"Helen Park, 管理合伙人",f13:`6 weeks`,f14:`Anthropic, Pinecone, SharePoint, Teams`,n1:`4`},{slug:`brightpath-realty`,f1:`Brightpath Realty`,f2:"房地产",f3:"全天候响应，40 秒回复客户线索",f4:`40 s`,f5:"客户线索首次回复用时",f6:"每一条房产平台咨询，都会在经纪人查看前得到回复、看房时段及一条 CRM 记录。",f7:"工作流自动化",img:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/t7VGq6b8rzt8deI2pJExlQ61qzM.webp`,f8:"房产平台的咨询要等数小时才得到回复，那时买家早已联系了另外三位经纪人。",f9:"线索智能体在一分钟内回复，识别买家需求、提供看房时段，并在人工查看前写入 CRM。",f10:"40 s|首次回复;+27%|看房预约量;100%|线索已录入 CRM;24/7|覆盖时段",f11:"高效、细致，并坦诚说明 AI 的能力边界。",f12:"Daniel Ortiz，首席运营官",f13:`3 weeks`,f14:`Make, HubSpot, Google Calendar, WhatsApp`,n1:`5`}]},ze=`FcCase@cms1`,Be=(e,t=`img`)=>String(e&&e[t]||``).split(`?`)[0],Ve=`data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D'http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg'%20viewBox%3D'0%200%20400%20500'%20preserveAspectRatio%3D'xMidYMid%20slice'%3E%3Crect%20width%3D'400'%20height%3D'500'%20fill%3D'%23D3D8E2'%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D'120'%20y%3D'170'%20width%3D'160'%20height%3D'160'%20rx%3D'8'%20fill%3D'none'%20stroke%3D'%23AEB6C6'%20stroke-width%3D'1.5'%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D'100'%20y%3D'150'%20width%3D'200'%20height%3D'200'%20rx%3D'10'%20fill%3D'none'%20stroke%3D'%23C3CAD8'%20stroke-width%3D'1'%20stroke-dasharray%3D'2%206'%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E`,Z=(e,t=`img`)=>Be(e,t)||Ve,He=a===void 0?h:r,Ue=e=>String(e||``).split(`;`).map(e=>e.trim()).filter(Boolean),We=e=>{let t=String(e||``).match(/^([^\d]*)([\d,]+(?:\.\d+)?)(.*)$/);if(!t)return{pre:``,n:0,dec:0,suf:String(e||``)};let n=t[2].replace(/,/g,``);return{pre:t[1],n:parseFloat(n)||0,dec:(n.split(`.`)[1]||``).length,suf:t[3]}},Ge=(e,t)=>{let[n,r]=e.toFixed(t).split(`.`);return n.replace(/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g,`,`)+(r?`.`+r:``)},Ke=`
.fccs{position:relative;background:var(--fc-bone);color:var(--fc-ink)}
.fccs-top{position:relative;min-height:max(680px,100svh);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden;background:var(--fc-night);color:var(--fc-cloud);--ex:0}
.fccs-ph{position:absolute;inset:0} .fccs-ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;scale:calc(1.18 - var(--ex)*.12);translate:0 calc(var(--ex)*60px);filter:brightness(.62) saturate(.9)} .fccs-ph::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--fc-night) 94%,transparent) 5%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--fc-night) 78%,transparent) 45%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--fc-night) 0.4%,transparent) 85%)}
.fccs-in{position:relative;padding-top:160px;padding-bottom:clamp(50px,6vw,90px)}
.fccs-cr ol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;list-style:none;margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fc-cloud) 78%,transparent)} .fccs-cr li+li::before{content:"/";margin-right:8px;opacity:.5} .fccs-cr a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none} .fccs-cr [aria-current]{color:var(--fc-cloud)}
.fccs-cl{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fc-brass)}
.fccs-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;margin-top:32px;padding:18px 24px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--fc-brass);color:var(--fc-ink)} .fccs-badge b{font-size:clamp(46px,4.4vw,76px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1} .fccs-badge span{font-size:14px;max-width:180px}
.fccs-body{padding:clamp(70px,8vw,130px) 0}
.fccs-res>p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fc-mut)} .fccs-res>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px} .fccs-res>div>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:26px 24px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--fc-cloud);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--fc-fog)} .fccs-res b{font-size:clamp(40px,3.6vw,64px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} .fccs-res span{font-size:14px;color:var(--fc-mut)}
.fccs-ch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;gap:clamp(24px,4vw,70px);margin-top:clamp(70px,8vw,120px);align-items:start}
.fccs-lab{position:sticky;top:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase} .fccs-lab em{font-style:normal;display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--fc-ink);color:var(--fc-brass);font-size:12px}
.fccs-txt{margin:0;font-size:clamp(26px,2.5vw,44px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.18}
.fccs-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin:40px 0 0} .fccs-facts dt{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fc-mut)} .fccs-facts dd{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:0} .fccs-facts dd span{padding:9px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--fc-cloud);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--fc-fog);font-size:13px}
.fccs-q{position:relative;margin:clamp(80px,9vw,140px) 0 0;padding:clamp(40px,5vw,80px);border-radius:36px;background:var(--fc-night);color:var(--fc-cloud);overflow:hidden}
.fccs-qm{position:absolute;right:30px;top:-40px;font-size:300px;line-height:1;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fc-brass) 78%,transparent)}
@media (max-width:699px){.fccs-q{padding-top:96px} .fccs-qm{font-size:200px;top:-44px;right:20px}}
.fccs-q blockquote{position:relative;margin:0;max-width:1100px;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,60px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.08} .fccs-q figcaption{margin-top:28px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fc-brass)}
.fccs-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:clamp(50px,6vw,90px)}
.fccs-next{position:relative;display:block;padding:clamp(70px,9vw,140px) 0;background:var(--fc-night);color:var(--fc-cloud);text-decoration:none;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}
.fccs-nph{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.25;transition:opacity .6s} .fccs-nph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;scale:1.1;transition:scale 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)} .fccs-next:hover .fccs-nph{opacity:.55} .fccs-next:hover .fccs-nph img{scale:1}
.fccs-nin{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px} .fccs-nin>span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fc-brass)} .fccs-nin b{max-width:1100px;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,90px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:.98} .fccs-nin i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--fc-brass);color:var(--fc-ink);transition:rotate .5s} .fccs-next:hover .fccs-nin i{rotate:-45deg}
